WEBVTT

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.910
A satellite rocket has just been launched from the Republic of Kazakhstan.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:14.790
But no one on Earth has any way of knowing that a Primeval Core...

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:18.890
...has attached itself to this very rocket.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.900
It's no good!

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.090
Earth...

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.770
All living things...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.560
We're all...

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.640
...gonna die!

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.210
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:40.110
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:47.460
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:51.730
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.960
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:02.050
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:06.750
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.710
It's time to launch!

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:13.890
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:17.810
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:22.510
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:25.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.390
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:31.140
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.650
Pulverizing steel!

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:38.320
Goldion Hammer!

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:45.850
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:51.850
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.670
Our very own King of Braves!

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:58.850
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:03.390
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:06.340
Showdown in the Darkness

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.190
<i>Showdown in the Darkness</i>

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.980
The asteroid cluster is now at 55,000 meters.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.660
It's still approaching on a collision course!

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:35.460
Just look how huge those meteorites are, and there's so many!

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:39.460
Who ever thought they would connect the ES Window to the asteroid belt...

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.660
Asteroid?

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.030
Asteroid belt...

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.130
It's a cluster of asteroids of varying sizes...

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:49.040
...exact number unknown, between Saturn and Mars.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:53.140
If even one of those things falls onto Earth it's going to be big trouble, right?

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.810
Is there any way we can stop that from happening, Chief?

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:01.790
Equipping StealthGao for long-term outer-space mode is still underway!

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.780
Mic Sounders Brigade...

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.320
The 6 machines that are flight-ready are now preparing for launch!

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.630
The 13th...

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:15.360
Launch!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.170
Here we go, guys!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:20.900
Go!

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.110
This one's for our brothers still in the shop.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.770
Let's give it all we've got!

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.610
Ul-tech Engine Drive Space Carrier Base, Izanagi, Attack Brigade No. 1...

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.180
...now ready to mobilize!

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:36.090
SP Pack Output Level stabilized.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.280
GekiRyuJin, we're ready to go anytime!

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.860
Climber 1, Navigation Program Final Check complete.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.760
System Change!

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:56.200
Mic Sounders!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.340
Baribarien Sound, standby!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.740
Disc X, set on!

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.150
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.620
C'mon, rock 'n' roll!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.790
Solitary Wave...

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.930
Fire!

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.240
Easy as pie and a piece of cake!

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:32.770
What?

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:42.420
No!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.450
What happened?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.620
It's a Primeval! It's being controlled by a Primeval!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.750
You can sense it, Mamoru?

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.060
Can you tell us where this Primeval is?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.270
Someplace far away...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.000
It's hiding.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:58.800
I think...

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.460
...somewhere in outer space.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.300
ChoRyuJin, GekiRyuJin, launch complete!

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:36.300
Now launching the Energy Supply Ship, Climber 1!

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:48.050
Drive Command, Communication and Control Ship, Susanoh...

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.920
...proceeding at maximum speed!

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.050
Reflector Beam, charge complete.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.500
FF Mirror, preparing for release.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.170
You guys!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.200
Shuang Tou Long!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.340
We owe you big time!

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:13.010
There's gonna be shockwaves!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.380
Don't let your guard down!

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.340
Level B 81%.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.450
Eraser Head!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:26.690
Just leave the rest to us.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.090
Sorry, guys!

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.590
Double Rifle!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:34.200
Shuang Tou Long!Shuang Tou Long!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.030
Now releasing the FF Mirror.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.220
Exposing the Reflector Beam!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:14.210
Positioning Control Program functioning at 100%!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.780
Gotta hand it to this SP Pack!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.230
Yahoo!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.440
You got it, guys! Pulverize those things!

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:22.450
Whatever you do, don't let them get near Earth!

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.480
Because if even one crash-lands, the damage will be irrevocable.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.380
You mean like the dinosaurs going extinct?

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.820
Exactly.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:34.090
65 million years ago...

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:38.660
...a 10km meteorite crashed onto the Yucatan Peninsula.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.590
The earth was enveloped by the dust resulting from the impact...

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.300
...and was transformed into a world without light...

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:47.430
...marking the start of a long winter.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:52.740
They say that's the reason why the dinosaurs died out.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:57.240
The enemy's probably planning to weaken the human race like this...

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:01.010
...so we can't resist, and then they'll Zonderize us all at once.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.180
And we've got to stop them from doing that, if nothing else!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.990
We've just got to pulverize them into oblivion!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.990
Anything under a diameter of 30m...

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:12.620
...will burst into flames from the friction created by the atmosphere!

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.520
Damn! Isn't the StealthGao ready yet?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.730
We've detected an unidentified flying object...

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.770
...in the Satellite Network above the skies of Australia!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:22.970
I'm putting it on the main display!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.140
It's a Primeval! There's no mistake!

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.910
So it's been hiding on the other side of the earth?

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.810
All right! GaoGaiGar! Let's go!

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:35.850
The time is drawing near...

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.590
My name is Cain...

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.160
The time is drawing near...

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.330
The time is drawing near...

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.700
Amaterasu, rapid launch!

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.370
Wow!

00:09:58.370 --> 00:09:59.700
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.370
Say, Hana...

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:06.570
What did you just wish for?

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.540
I-It's a secret!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.450
I know what it is!

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.850
It's about Mamoru, right?

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:20.220
Ah! My beloved Master Mamoru! Hurry up and make me your wife!

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:21.190
Right?

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:22.290
Oh, please...

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.450
Still, that Mamoru's running really late!

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:28.360
You don't suppose he's planning to ditch the astronomy assignment?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.130
Huh? What the heck's going on?

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:31.640
Huh?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.970
GGG's in battle!

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.120
Volfogg!

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:55.790
Susanoh's energy cable has been damaged! Further combat impossible!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.260
No! Get a move on, GekiRyuJin!

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.490
Roger that, ChoRyuJin!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:08.970
My calculations tell me that we're not going to reach it in time.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.010
What should we do?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.500
It's going to hit Earth!

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:44.940
What the!

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:46.080
That's...

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.340
...the J-Ark!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.190
Earth is so beautiful.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.760
Just like my home planet...

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.850
We're not gonna let them top us!

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:30.010
Of course not!

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.320
Double Gun!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.020
Shuang Tou Long!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.420
I've found you, 31 Machine Primevals!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.670
It's manipulating the asteroids remotely?

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:26.510
Augh!

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.550
What?

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:30.310
Mamoru? Is that you, Mamoru?

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.510
Y-Yeah.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.480
What are you doing riding in StealthGao?

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:49.060
GaoGaiGar. The Legacy of Cain. Destroy them! Destroy them!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:54.140
Gatling Driver!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.120
All right! You pulverized the meteorite!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.150
Now it's your turn!

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.730
B-But these guys are...

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.130
This can't be possible!

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.200
So they survived?

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.210
Gai...

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.020
You've regained consciousness... Gai.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.880
Mikoto? Dad?

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.550
What about the Primevals?

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.330
And Mamoru? Has the planet been saved?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.870
Was I defeated?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.070
Or did I...

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.870
My body...

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:01.000
What's going on here?

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.200
You've been asleep...

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:04.670
...for a very long time.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.340
I was asleep?

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.740
That's right.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:12.020
It's been two years since you were in that space shuttle accident.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:15.910
But then what about GGG? And Galeon? And the Zonders?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.090
So... you've been dreaming.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:24.420
I can see that it must've been quite a realistic dream.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:26.790
But I...

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.710
You...

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.050
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:51.950
Why are you so angry?

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.660
This isn't where I'm supposed to be.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:00.490
Is that what you're trying to tell me?

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.130
Big Brother Gai!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.260
Big Brother Gai!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.160
I get it, this is just...

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.670
...an illusion!

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.780
Who knew you'd tune into my brain waves and make me hallucinate.

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:19.250
You've got a lot of nerve!

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:21.980
Thank goodness! You woke up, Big Brother Gai!

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.260
What's this? I can't move!

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:33.100
The pressure's unbelievable!

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:35.930
Big Brother Gai!

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.110
Stop it!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.850
Huh? I can move now.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:53.680
Mamoru!

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:00.680
All right!

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:07.720
Gatling Driver!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.870
Goldion Hammer!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.050
Hammer Hell!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.120
Hammer Heaven!

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:41.600
Transform into light!

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:55.170
You did it!

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.810
That's the last one!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.320
Look at that!

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:09.090
The ES Window's about to disappear!

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:12.200
That means GaoGaiGar defeated the Primeval!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.640
Shouldn't we retrieve that Primeval Core?

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.470
There's no hurry.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:31.280
After all, those people can't do anything with it.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.380
I suppose you're right.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.210
J-Ark, withdraw at maximum speed!

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.650
Roger!

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:53.600
Mamoru, do you think you can Purify this?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.070
The time is drawing near...

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:00.540
Yeah! I'm going to give it a try!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.980
Curatio!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.540
Teneritas!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.050
Sectio!

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:09.380
Salus!

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.550
Coctura!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:22.130
I did it... I can do it, too!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:23.740
Good for you, Mamoru!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:24.630
Yeah!

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.570
We can't stop it!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:28.940
What's the matter? GekiRyuJin!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:41.250
The biggest troublemaker of all is still with us! And it's huge.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:42.710
This isn't good.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.790
It's got a diameter of at least 500 meters!

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.620
If that should land here on Earth...

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:49.720
No question about it, mankind will be annihilated!

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:52.330
Just like the dinosaurs died out!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.260
What's the status on the attack squad?

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:57.590
Both the Mic Brigade and Susanoh have been immobilized!

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:01.670
GaoGaiGar is moving in, but our calculations say he won't make it!

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:04.110
What about ChoRyuJin and GekiRyuJin?

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:07.240
They're nowhere near armed enough to compete with that thing!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.810
Then there's only one thing to do.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.050
We're thinking the same thing, huh?

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:16.190
You and I are more or less brothers.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.450
GekiRyuJin...

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:22.790
We haven't known each other for long, but thanks for everything, ChoRyuJin.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.590
Don't tell me you're...

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:27.530
You're indispensable to GGG.

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:30.690
This is a task for a newcomer like me!

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:32.730
Come back here, GekiRyuJin!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.670
There's no time to argue!

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.630
Wh-What do you think you're doing?

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:38.810
Come back here, you!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.710
This is my job.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.150
ChoRyuJin!

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:48.410
ChoRyuJin is headed for the asteroid!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:49.420
What?

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.490
But that's crazy!

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:54.820
ChoRyuJin!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.400
Maximum output!

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.010
He's pushing back the asteroid.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:12.400
ChoRyuJin...

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:13.840
ChoRyuJin!

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:27.260
The asteroid's retraction rate is at 99.9%!

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:30.530
The ES Window is now disappearing!

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:31.920
What about ChoRyuJin?

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:34.860
Returning under those conditions...

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:36.870
It's impossible...

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:39.030
He's being sucked into the asteroid belt, then?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:44.270
Most likely, he's doomed to wander between Mars and Saturn...

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:45.710
...for all time.

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:51.440
ChoRyuJin!

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:54.650
But I...

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:59.380
But I still have so much to learn from you...

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:00.710
ChoRyuJin...

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:03.630
You fool!

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:06.360
Can you hear me, ChoRyuJin?

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.330
Yes, I can hear you.

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:10.500
Someday, I promise you...

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:12.970
I promise to bring you back from there!

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:15.910
And I'm coming with him! No matter what!

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:19.140
Roger...

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:24.710
Until that day comes, please look after my younger brother, GekiRyuJin.

00:22:26.850 --> 00:22:29.150
I'll be waiting. Always...

00:22:29.860 --> 00:22:32.090
And I believe for sure...

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:35.220
...that one day we'll be reunited.

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:39.020
Someday in the sea of stars.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

